# Nebulus input: dead-loop removal for the TURN entry (NebInput2), DEFAULT YES since v1.1 (the user tried it and kept it; gate: work/notes/input.md section 11.2).
# $39e1e (direction change from standing) sets player state 3, clears the step and `rts`; the turn handler $39e2e (pose table $3a0d6) first ran in the NEXT loop,
# so the first turn pose appeared 2 loops later (poll -> pose 83 ms). The entry now falls into $39e2e (43 ms).
#   $39e2c  4e75 (rts at the end of $39e1e)  -> 4e71  nop (falls into $39e2e)
patch ni_turn
default yes
site 39e2c 4e71
